# Pairs with ListedRestorable. The other half of production before the fix of
# #5637: the delete's lease was never renewed while it deleted artifacts, so
# it could run out first; a rebuild then re-listed the still-whole backup, and
# the delete went on to delete the artifacts of the listed backup.
MODULE: ListedRestorableArtifactsAfterLapse
TARGET: ListedRestorable
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a delete deletes artifacts after its lease ran out
PERTURBS: DelArt

--- FIND
    /\ del[d] = "begun"
    /\ lease[d] = "live"
    /\ art' = IF gen = dgen[d] THEN FALSE ELSE art
--- REPLACE
    /\ del[d] = "begun"
    \* MUTATION: artifacts are deleted whether or not the lease is live.
    /\ art' = IF gen = dgen[d] THEN FALSE ELSE art
--- END
